    equivalent of the existing Setpoint (chamber target) line, styled to
    match it (same dashed rhythm and stroke width) but tinted with the
    beer series' own accent color at reduced opacity, so it reads as
    paired with the beer temp line rather than a second chamber setpoint.
    Deliberately real-data-only, no forward-projection continuation past
